==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{term|agrounde|lang=enm}}, {{term|on grounde||on ground|lang=enm}}, equivalent to {{prefix|a|ground}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|aʊnd}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{context|nautical|of a normally floating craft|lang=en}} Resting on the [[bottom]].
# {{cx|1811|lang=en}} Stuck fast, stopped, at a loss, ruined, like a boat which has run aground.

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# {{context|nautical|of a normally floating craft|lang=en}} Resting on the [[bottom]].

